* The transit pod in the tube by the lab (openc2e Creatures 2 project, our
* own script), retired. The pod (3 6 3) carried creatures between its dock
* by the domed lab and a ledge at the gene lab; since 2026-11-19 the tube is
* walked instead (tube-walk.cos, which also removes the pod and its two
* callers, the world file's). This file now only clears the pieces it made
* in earlier versions (a world saved with them) and keeps the lab powered.
* Run by openc2e after the world loads (Additions folder); safe to repeat.
enum 2 2 214 kill targ next
enum 2 2 215 kill targ next
enum 2 1 143 kill targ next
enum 2 2 219 kill targ next

* The lab starts powered (owner, 2026-11-09). The lab's power switch (3 10
* 11, left of the dock) starts the lab's machines (3 10 8-10) and enables
* the lab console (2 2 21, OV01) (and the pod's dock button, 2 2 22, gone
* now). The first time, it also moves the camera to the lab and shows a
* message, unless the console's OV02 is already 1; we set that first so the
* start is quiet, then press the switch.
enum 2 2 21 setv ov02 1 next
enum 3 10 11 doif ov00 eq 0 mesg writ targ 0 endi next
